Timmy Time Adventure: controls
==============================

The keys as the game sets them the first time (Options changes them;
they are kept in the drawer's User drawer, User/TIMMY.CFG).

  Cursor keys     move, climb, crouch
  Z               jump (hold for a higher jump)
  X               pick up and throw, punch while jumping
  Down + X        short throw
  Return          confirm
  Esc             the menu
  Space           pause

The menus: cursor keys and Return.
